<title>USA: DSG International Ltd sets dutch auction.</title>
<headline>DSG International Ltd sets dutch auction.</headline>
<dateline>DULUTH, Ga. 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>DSG International Ltd said Wednesday that it has begun a Dutch Auction self tender for up to 850,000 common shares.</p>
<p>Shareholders may tender shares for between $12.75 and $14.50 per share. The offer expires at midnight, December 31, unless extended, the company said.  </p>
<p>DSG shares rose 1-1/2 Wednesday morning to trade at 13-3/8.</p>
<p>DSG, which makes and distributes disposable diapers, said it expects to fund the repurchase primarily from cash on hand and bank borrowings.</p>
</text>
